---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
    title="How it works"
    description="Filters, a loop, and a course file for the head unit."
>
    <main class="shell page">
        <p class="kicker">How it works</p>
        <h1>The line comes from the map, not from a guess.</h1>
        <div class="prose">
            <p>
                You set a start pin, a sport, a distance, a surface, and an
                elevation bias. Traceway asks a routing engine for several loops
                and ranks them. Distance error, paved share, climb, cycleways,
                trunk roads, and ferries decide the order.
            </p>
            <p>
                Unknown surface stays unknown. A sentence can fill the same
                filters later. It does not invent coordinates.
            </p>
            <p>
                The planner itself lives in the app. This site is the quiet
                explanation you can read before you open it.
            </p>
            <a class="button" href="/dashboard">Open the planner</a>
        </div>
    </main>
</Base>
